        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Abraham Bankier, Oskar Schindler\n- Companies: Munich Rekord factory\n- Organizations: Nazi Party\n- Events: The Holocaust\n\nFacts:\n- Abraham Bankier was one of the owners of the Munich Rekord factory.\n- Oskar Schindler took over the Munich Rekord factory from its prior owners.\n- Oskar Schindler was a German industrialist, a spy, and a member of the Nazi Party.\n- During the Holocaust, Oskar Schindler was credited with saving 1,200 Jews.",
